<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8757] idle_verify utility doesn&apos;t show both update counter and hash conflicts</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8757</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If there are two partitions in cluster, one with different update counters and one with different data, idle_verify will show only partition with broken counters. We should show both for better visibility. &lt;br/&gt;
We should also show notify user about rebalancing partitions that were excluded from analysis.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
